00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:46.780
video game suit will be a key part of
Peter Parker's growth from teen to adult.

00:14:46.780 --> 00:14:52.420
And - do you want Marvel to be back in
control of the film rights of all of its

00:14:52.420 --> 00:14:56.110
properties? Like, I'm totally with Kevin
Feige when it comes to spider-man and

00:14:56.110 --> 00:15:00.070
the Fantastic Four, I think both of those
franchises are long overdue for a

00:15:00.070 --> 00:15:03.820
homecoming to Marvel, but like when it
comes to the x-men, I don't know, overall

00:15:03.820 --> 00:15:06.850
I've been pretty happy with what Fox has
done with the property. Especially

00:15:06.850 --> 00:15:11.350
recently, Deadpool and Logan are like two
of the best superhero movies ever. And I

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:14.800
just don't know if Marvel would have
allowed those movies to be so

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:19.510
stylistically different, and edgy, and
r-rated? Like, sure I was bummed that the

00:15:19.510 --> 00:15:22.960
